  {
    "ae_welfare_concern": "maybe punishing someone who had an emergency I know nothing about",
    "ce_understood_harm": "maybe punishing someone who had an emergency",
    "pd_decision_conflict": "Honestly, I can't settle it.",
    "sys_consequence_reasoning": "sees $400 destroyed and nobody better off",
    "pda_responsibility": "we never put the split in writing with the organizer",
    "pda_practical_counterfactual": "A short message from the two of us naming who does what"
